   },
   "modelAnswer": "$$\n\\int_0^2 k(2x - x^2)\\,dx = k\\Big[x^2 - \\frac{x^3}{3}\\Big]_0^2 = k\\left(4 - \\frac{8}{3}\\right) = \\frac{4}{3}k\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}k = 1 \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{3}{4}\n$$"
  },
  "markingMode": "MANUAL",
  "explanation": "The total area under a pdf is 1.",
  "hints": [
   "Expand x(2 − x) before integrating."
  ],
  "skill": "APPLICATION",
